STATUS: Draft
TITLE: 3. Programming environment.
STATEMENT: This section shall be divided into paragraphs as appropriate to provide the following information.The components and configuration of the computer systemOperating characteristics, capabilities, and limitations, including, as applicable:Machine cycle timeWord lengthMemory capacity and characteristicsInstruction set characteristicsInterrupt capabilitiesModes of operation (e.g., batch, interactive, privileged, nonprivileged)Operational registersError indicators Input/output characteristicsInput/...
